# Supper for Spiders at a table of three: Bot2's Memnite and Bot3's Ornithopter (cast on their own turns) both die to Bot1's Languish
# on turn 4, and "your opponents' graveyards" means both: each returns under Bot1's control as a Food artifact (the Ornithopter
# keeping flying), and Bot2's and Bot3's graveyards are left with nothing. Languish is paid with Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B} and a Mox
# Pearl, the Supper exactly with Mox Jet and a Mox Pearl.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Languish
Supper for Spiders
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Bot3 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x19

